5. **Verify per group; delegate where it helps.** Delegate surveys and migrations wherever it helps: hand off a bounded, independent area or migration group whenever collaboration tools are available and delegation materially helps, and execute locally when it does not. When delegating, dispatch a read-only sub-agent for a read-only survey or a writing sub-agent for a migration, and give it the narrow brief in `references/orchestration_spec.md`; a migration agent writes only its own group's files. Either way: disjoint file ownership per group, re-run every check yourself (never trust a self-reported pass), commit once per verified group, retry ≤2, restore what still fails.
